                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Last night, I voted to pass R. 3944 - The Military Construction, Veterans Affairs, and Related Agencies Appropriations Act of 2026, which makes critical investments in the healthcare of our veterans and our nation\u2019s military infrastructure.\n\nI\u00a0am proud to have successfully advocated for and secured vital funding in this initial package to improve our local military infrastructure, including a new state-of-the-art child development center at NAWS China Lake and a new F-35 Aircraft Maintenance Hanger NAS Lemoore. \n\nOur district is blessed to be home to many veterans, as well as active duty servicemembers who contribute to our national security. It is an honor to fight for them here in Congress! \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 \n\nLearn more: https://t.co/FiEMzEvRNu",
